<h2 id="to-address-of-the-lovely-juliet">To-address of the lovely Juliet</h2>
<p>Juliet
House of Capulet
Verona</p>
<h2 id="from">From</h2>
<p>House of Montague
Verona</p>
<h2 id="location">Location</h2>
<div class="org-center">
<p><strong>Montague</strong></p>
</div>
<h2 id="dear-juliet">Dear Juliet,</h2>
<p class="verse">Then plainly know my heart’s dear love is set<br>
On the fair daughter of rich Capulet:<br>
As mine on hers, so hers is set on mine;<br>
And all combin’d, save what thou must combine<br>
By holy marriage: when, and where, and how<br>
We met, we woo’d, and made exchange of vow,<br>
I’ll tell thee as we pass; but this I pray,<br>
That thou consent to marry us to-day.<br>
</p>
<h2 id="yours-truly">Yours truly,</h2>
<p>Romeo of House Montague</p>
